H2O Lightning 4B experimental preview

The separate model assets are derived from H2O.ai's h2o-lightning-4b checkpoint,
revision 052bb7d48c71abcd769d91994792bbc664b7681e, built on Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B
by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud). The corresponding model card identifies both
as Apache-2.0:

https://huggingface.co/h2oai/h2o-lightning-4b/tree/052bb7d48c71abcd769d91994792bbc664b7681e
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B

The initial source investigation used revision
7cfa35c5c71f656555df5243869268c3a1d4d3be. The saved Hub metadata comparison
reports the same checkpoint LFS identifier and size for both revisions; it
did not independently hash the full checkpoint body from each revision.

The project does not include or distribute the model weights in this package.
Check the applicable terms, attribution, notices and converted-asset
distribution obligations before providing those assets separately.

The H2O source adapter uses fast-sha256 1.3.0 with an ESM wrapper; see
H2O-SHA256-LICENSE for that component's license.
